Beast 3.0 Agriculture & Food Security Division
The Agriculture & Food Security Division serves as the food production and distribution authority for the Beast 3.0 Framework.

Mission
Promote sustainable food systems, agricultural development, nutritional wellbeing, and resource accessibility.

Core Responsibilities
Food Security
Community Agriculture
Food Distribution
Farm Development
Nutritional Programs
Emergency Food Resources
Agricultural Education
Strategic Objectives
Reduce Hunger
Increase Food Accessibility
Strengthen Local Agriculture
Support Sustainable Farming
Improve Community Health
Status
Development
